            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus strain 19 soluble protein extract subunit vaccine. Highest and most sustained antibody responses were elicited by the S19 vaccine. Minimal humoral responses were induced by SPEBA alone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
