            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Combination vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus BCSP31 salmonella chi 4064 vector vaccine. Orally immunized swine developed serum and intestinal antibody responses to BCSP31 and salmonella endotoxin. Effective stimulation of mucosal and systemic antibody-mediated immunity was observed after oral immunization with recombinant s. Typhimurium expressing bcsp31, but no antigen-specific delayed-type hypersensitivity or blastogenic response was induced by this route.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:1908827</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:2114357</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>live attenuated Brucella abortus BCSP31 Salmonella chi 4064 vector vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


