            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Inactivated Brucella ovis vaccine using inactivated Brucella ovis vitamin E adjuvanted vaccine. Elevated and sustained serum antibody levels indicating a strong serological response, likely boosted by natural infection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Brucella ovis-vitamin E adjuvant vaccine</obo:IAO_0000118>
