            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus rough-strain outer membrane-peptidoglycan complex subunit vaccine. Frequency of lymphocyte responsiveness increased with dose and with two inoculations compared to single inoculations. Induction of lymphocyte proliferation responses in cattle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
