            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using subcellular proteins freed of rough lipopolysaccharide, including five major protein groups identified by molecular weight, present in hot saline extracts and outer membrane blebs. Not directly reported. Sheep infected with b. Ovis produce antibody responses to rough lipopolysaccharide and proteins in hot saline extracts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
