        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus strain 19 chemically modified salt-extractable protein (dcsp) subunit vaccine. No significant protection observed. Vaccination stimulated marked antibody responses and increased cell-mediated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
