            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using recombinant 31-kda protein expressed in E. Coli from its native promoter. Preliminary evidence showed protection against experimental brucellosis in rodents by the purified 31-kda protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
