        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Inactivated Brucella melitensis vaccine using inactivated Brucella melitensis killed cells vaccine. Vaccination reduced b. Abortus live cells in spleen. Tetramisole stimulation of vaccination was not accompanied by increases in specific antibodies as measured by three serological tests.</obo:IAO_0000115>
