            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine containing protein-bound peptidoglycan subunit. Vaccination reduced placental colonization frequency and bacterial load in placenta and spleen. Immunity transferred by immune serum protected against placental colonization.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
