        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus cu-zn SOD synthetic peptide vaccine. Peptide 3 plus monophosphoryl lipid A afforded a 2 log reduction in bacterial load. Peptide-specific igg antibodies were induced and enhanced by monophosphoryl lipid A.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
