                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella ovis subunit vaccine using monoclonal antibodies directed against multiple outer membrane proteins and rough lipopolysaccharide were tested individually and in combination. Mixtures of mabs against specific omps and anti-r-lps mab alone conferred significant protection compared to controls. Protective antibodies targeted b. Ovis outer membrane proteins and rough lipopolysaccharide, indicating these antigens as candidates for subcellular vaccines.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:7562998</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella ovis Omp and rough lipopolysaccharide subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


