        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant vaccinia virus expressing the 28 kda protein composed of B. Abortus cu/zn-sod and a portion of vaccinia virus TK gene. Vubsod did not induce a humoral. Mice inoculated with vubsod responded with antibodies to vaccinia virus but not to b. Abortus cu/zn-sod protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
