            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella ovis subunit vaccine using Brucella ovis hot saline extract subunit vaccine. Hs-qs-21 vaccine afforded protection against b. Ovis challenge as good as that developed after primary infection and as good as or better than that provided by attenuated Brucella melitensis strain Rev. 1 vaccine. Protection mediated by both T lymphocytes and antibodies, with antibodies playing a substantially greater role.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
