            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Combination vaccine using live attenuated salmonella choleraesuis chi 3781 mutant carrying recombinant plasmid pba31-r7 expressing Brucella abortus BCSP31 protein. Recombinant salmonella choleraesuis vaccine colonized gut mucosa and deep tissues in mice and swine. Mice developed serum antibodies to BCSP31 and salmonella endotoxin and local intestinal antibody response to salmonella endotoxin but not BCSP31.</obo:IAO_0000115>
