            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant vaccinia virus expressing the 18-kda outer membrane protein. Mice inoculated with the recombinant virus were not protected against challenge with virulent b. Abortus 2308. Inoculated mice produced 18-kda protein-specific antibodies predominantly of igg2a isotype.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
