        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using purified 22.9-kda protein used as protective immunogen. 22.9-kDa protein was as effective as the live Brucella abortus strain RB51 vaccine in protection studies. 22.9-kDa protein induced a strong in vitro blast transformation in lymphoid cells from previously sensitized mice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
