        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant baculoviruses expressing Brucella abortus heat shock protein HtrA were produced in insect cell lines (sf9 and trichoplusia ni) under optimized conditions for protein expression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
