        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant vaccinia virus expressing Brucella abortus groel protein. Mice produced groel and vaccinia virus specific antibodies after inoculation with the recombinant vaccine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
