            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using the L7/L12 gene was expressed in lactococcus lactis under a nisin-inducible promoter, producing the antigen in cytoplasmic, secreted, and cell-wall-anchored forms using different signal peptides and fusion constructs to enhance yield and targeting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
