        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus DNA vaccine using naked-dna plasmids encoding bacterioferritin delivered by live attenuated yersinia enterocolitica o:3 or o:9 strains via intragastric immunization. Induced antigen-specific th1-type. Induction of antigen-specific serum immunoglobulin and th1-type responses including lymphocyte proliferation and gamma interferon production.</obo:IAO_0000115>
