        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus purified recombinant groel/groes/htra subunit vaccine. No protection against b. Abortus virulent strain 2308 challenge was observed. Antibodies were detected against groel and htra but not groes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
