            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus DNA vaccine using plasmid DNA carrying the SOD gene (pcdna-sod) administered by intramuscular injection. Dna vaccine induced a strong, significant level of protection against challenge with b. Abortus strain 2308, comparable to protection induced by b. Abortus vaccine strain RB51. Induced sod-specific antibodies with igg2a dominance over igg1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:12933826</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella abortus Cu-Zn SOD DNA vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


