            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using both heat-killed and living cells of the strain were used as. Demonstrated immunization of goats against brucella infection and protection against abortion. Included investigation of cross-immunity between tubercle bacilli and brucellae infections using monocytes from vaccinated and unvaccinated rabbits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:13596891</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>live attenuated Brucella melitensis strain streptomycin non dependent vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


