            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus pnca mutant vaccine. Pnca mutant showed a 1.5-log reduction in bacterial load in mouse spleens after 10 weeks and fully retained protective ability against virulent b. Abortus strain 544.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
