        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella lumazine synthase subunit vaccine. Bls is highly immunogenic, presumably due to its repetitive and organized homodecameric arrangement, which is expected to induce strong.</obo:IAO_0000115>
