        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus virb4 mutant vaccine. Virb4 mutant did not induce abortion in pregnant mice. Infection with the virb4 mutant did not induce transient ifn-gamma production during placental development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
