        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis DNA vaccine using purified recombinant plasmid encoding bp26 used for intramuscular DNA immunization. Bp26 DNA vaccine conferred protection against wild-type b. Melitensis 16M challenge. Induced elevated serum igg antibodies without igg subclass bias.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
