            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus strain 19 vaccine administered with or without recombinant bovine IL 2. Co-administration of rboil 2 with S19 resulted in significant augmentation of lymphoproliferation responses and provided significant protection against abortion and infection compared to vaccination alone or no treatment. Vaccinates receiving rboil 2 showed significantly higher antibody responses.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Brucella abortus soluble protein extract (SPEBA) vaccine</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:16242273</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella abortus soluble protein extract subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


