            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis omp31 48-74 peptide subunit vaccine. Immunization with romp31 conferred protection against b. Melitensis and b. Ovis infection. Romp31 induced a vigorous igg response with higher igg1 than igg2 titers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
