            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus DNA vaccine using plasmid DNA encoding a secretory fusion protein of SOD and IL-2 (psectag-sod-il2) compared to plasmid encoding SOD alone (psectag-sod). Both DNA vaccines induced sod-specific antibody and cytotoxic T cell responses. Induction of sod-specific antibodies, T cell proliferation, cytotoxic T cell responses, and ifn-gamma secretion.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:16446171</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella abortus Cu-Zn SOD DNA vaccine fused to IL-2</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


