        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using identification of immunogenic proteins from B. Abortus cell envelope using proteomic techniques including 2-de, MALDI-TOF ms, and LC-MS/MS. Several new immunogenic proteins identified by western blot using antisera from infected bovine and human patients, indicating potential to elicit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
