        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated unmarked deletion mutant of asp24 gene. Deltaasp24 mutants showed superior protection compared to current vaccine strains and other deletion mutants (deltamanba and deltavirb2) against homologous and heterologous challenge infections. No direct association between protection and cytokine response was apparent.</obo:IAO_0000115>
