        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus strain 19 babesia bovis RAP1 recombinant vaccine. Mice immunized with recombinant strains developed specific humoral. Strong humoral and cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
