            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus DNA vaccine using liposome-mediated delivery of DNA constructs pvsod (encoding SOD of Brucella abortus) and pvil18-sod (encoding mouse IL-18 and SOD of Brucella abortus) using escherichia coli lipid liposome (escheriosome) as the delivery vehicle. Co-expression of IL-18 with SOD resulted in higher lymphoproliferative response and ifn-gamma production compared to immunization with free form sod-dna, indicating enhanced protection potential. Induction of sod-specific humoral and cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:18602490</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella abortus Cu-Zn SOD and interleukin-18 DNA vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


