        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus hsp60 subunit vaccine. Sera from brucellosis patients reacted strongly with hsp60 and other bacterial proteins, indicating the immunogenicity of hsp60. No reactivity was observed with sera from healthy individuals, suggesting a specific.</obo:IAO_0000115>
