        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella vaccine using escherichia coli modified to express yersinia invasin and listeria listeriolysin O (llo) to enable infectivity and antigen release. E. Coli vaccine vector infected all tested cells and efficiently delivered therapeutics. Induction of th1 cytokine profile and specific cytotoxic T lymphocyte responses, indicating cell mediated immunity against Brucella antigens.</obo:IAO_0000115>
