        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated rough mutant with wboa deletion. Wrr51 showed better survival in hmdms compared to WRRP1 and less attenuation in mice compared to dual mutant WRRP1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
