        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus wbkc gene disruption vaccine. Wbkc mutant strains were attenuated in macrophages and mice. Mutants induced higher levels of IL-12 and tnf-alpha in macrophages compared to parental smooth strains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
