        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using recombinant B. Abortus S19 strains carrying genes coding for MPB83 fused to β-galactosidase, omp19, or BP26 expressed from replicative or integrative plasmids. Recombinant S19 strains induced specific inf-γ production against MPB83. Specific cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
