            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using strain rb51leub was used as a platform with an antibiotic-resistance marker free plasmid to construct strains over-expressing SOD alone, SOD and l7/l12, or SOD and wboa. All vaccine groups significantly protected mice compared to controls (p&lt;0.05). Over-expression of Brucella antigens in strain rb51leub elicited protective.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
