        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using recombinant cu-zn SOD protein encapsulated in fusogenic liposomes (escheriosomes). Immunization with liposome-encapsulated rsod alone or combined with ril-18 increased resistance in mice against challenge with b. Abortus 544. Escheriosomes encapsulated rsod induced.</obo:IAO_0000115>
