        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated δznua B. Melitensis administered orally. Single oral vaccination rapidly cleared from mice within 2 weeks. Vaccination stimulated ifn-γ, il-17, and IL-22.</obo:IAO_0000115>
