            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using recombinant rs-α protein expressed in escherichia coli as a his-tag fusion protein. Mice vaccinated with recombinant rs-α showed partial protection against Brucella melitensis infection. Vaccinated mice splenocytes produced ifn-γ and IL-2 but not IL-4 or IL-10 upon in vitro stimulation with recombinant rs-α, indicating a th1-type.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
