        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using oral administration of lactococcus lactis NZ9000 transformed with psec derivatives encoding SOD. Vaccinated animals were protected against challenge with virulent Brucella abortus strain 2308. Induction of anti-sod-specific igm and igg2a dominated igg responses in sera.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
