        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using recombinant omp25 administered via intraperitoneal and intradermal routes. Intradermal immunization significantly reduced splenic colonization of Brucella abortus. Immunization induced a mixed th1 and th2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
