            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis recombinant vector vaccine using escherichia coli dh5α engineered to express inv gene from yersinia pseudotuberculosis and hly gene from listeria monocytogenes, carrying plasmid expressing B. Melitensis omp31. Invasive e. Coli vaccine expressing omp31 induced significant protection against b. Melitensis challenge in mice. E. Coli delivery system is non-pathogenic and delivers antigens to antigen-presenting cells promoting cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
