        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus strain 19 virb5 gene deletion mutant vaccine. Recombinant virb5 antigen could discriminate mice infected with wild-type b. Abortus from those infected with the virb5 mutant strain, indicating potential as a serological marker.</obo:IAO_0000115>
