            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Inactivated Brucella melitensis vaccine using inactivated heat-killed Brucella melitensis 16 M vaccine. Enhanced immunogenicity with increased th1-type cytokine ifn-γ, il-4, and immunoglobulin G levels indicating a strong cellular and humoral.</obo:IAO_0000115>
