        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus flgj subunit vaccine. Induced vigorous immunoglobulin G response and stimulated splenocytes to secrete ifn-γ, indicating humoral and cell-mediated immunity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
