        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella canis vaccine using live attenuated Brucella canis virb10 mutant strain. Virb10 mutant was cleared by day 21 post-infection and significantly reduced CFU recovery after challenge with wild-type b. Canis at day 15, indicating protective immunity. Similar antibody isotype levels (igg1, igg2a, igg2b, igm) compared to wild-type.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
