        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using recombinant expression of selected outer membrane proteins (omp22, hia, btub, flgk) was performed for validation. Omp22 and hia showed high adhesin probability and conferred invasive capacity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
