            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis DNA vaccine using DNA plasmid pcisp41 encoding SP41 protein. Dna-sp41 vaccination induced specific igg and t-cell responses but provided lower protection against b. Melitensis 16M challenge in mice compared to the attenuated b. Melitensis Rev. 1 vaccine. Induction of sp41-specific serum igg antibodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>DNA vaccine encoding SP41 from Brucella melitensis</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23592643</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella melitensis SP41 DNA vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


