        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated Brucella melitensis strain 16M with hfq gene deletion. Reduced survival of the mutant strain in macrophages and mice. Induction of anti-brucella-specific igg1 and igg2a subtype responses.</obo:IAO_0000115>
