        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus strain 19 wzm gene deletion vaccine. Immunity-eliciting ability was similar to wzt mutant but reduced compared with the S19 strain. Cytokine secretion and inf-γ induction were measured.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
