            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using four recombinant influenza A viral constructs of subtypes H5N1 or H1N1 expressing L7/L12 were produced. Highest antibody response to Brucella antigen was observed with L7/L12 expressing constructs. Strong antibody response (elisa GMT 242.5-735.0) induced by L7/L12 constructs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
