        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using A synthetic chimeric gene encoding fragments of tf, BP26 (93-111), and omp31 (48-74) proteins was designed and modeled in silico to predict the 3D structure. Chimeric protein is predicted to induce both b-cell and t-cell mediated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
