        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella ovis vaccine using live attenuated Brucella ovis omp22 deletion vaccine. Protective efficacy against b. Ovis similar to that observed with b. Ovis attenuated mutants. Induced anti-b. Ovis antibodies of igg1, igg2a, and igg2b subclasses at lower levels than b. Ovis mutants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
