        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella ovis vaccine using live attenuated wadb mutant strain of Brucella ovis. Wadb mutant was attenuated in mice and protected them against b. Ovis challenge.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
