            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis DnaK and omp31 subunit vaccine. Mice vaccinated with DnaK showed significant protection against Brucella infection compared to controls (p&lt;0.001), though less than protection by Rev. 1 vaccine (p&lt;0.05). Strong lymphocyte proliferative response.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25240754</obo:IAO_0000119>
