            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella virb9 subunit vaccine. Mice immunized with virb7 showed almost 1 log reduction in spleen bacterial load after challenge with live Brucella abortus compared to unvaccinated controls. Immunized mice splenocytes produced significant and specific ifn-γ without il-4, indicating a th1-type response.</obo:IAO_0000115>
