        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated δmfp::kan mutant strain of Brucella abortus. Δmfp::kan strain induced greater protection than the RB51 vaccine and similar protection to the S19 vaccine in mouse models.</obo:IAO_0000115>
