        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus LPS was conjugated to neisseria meningitidis serogroup B outer membrane vesicle (omv) using carbodiimide and adipic acid-mediated coupling and linking. Lps-omv conjugate induced the highest anti-lps igg titers, approximately 5-fold and 1.3-fold higher than LPS alone and LPS + OMV noncovalent complex, respectively, with a 100-120-fold rise of anti-lps igg in mice after the third injection. Conjugated LPS-OMV elicited significantly higher igg antibody titers against LPS compared to other formulations, indicating strong immunogenicity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
