            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant pseudorabies virus with δtk/δge deletions expressing Brucella melitensis bp26 gene. Recombinant virus elicited high titers of humoral antibodies against Brucella and pseudorabies virus, and induced strong brucella-specific lymphocyte proliferation and interferon gamma production. Induction of both humoral immunity (high antibody titers) and cellular immunity (lymphocyte proliferation and interferon gamma production) against Brucella and pseudorabies virus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
