            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus L7/L12 omp16 influenza viral vector vaccine. Provided 100% protection against abortion in vaccinated pregnant heifers and 90-100% cross-protection of heifers and their calves or fetuses after challenge with b. Melitensis 16M.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
