            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using recombinant proteins romp31 and rtf used alone or combined as a cocktail. Combination of romp31 and rtf provided protection against Brucella melitensis infection comparable to the live attenuated vaccine strain Rev. 1. Immunized mice showed strong antigen-specific antibody responses (igg1 and igg2a), robust lymphocyte proliferation, elevated cytokine production (ifn-γ, il-12, il-10, il-6), and increased CD4 and CD8 T cell frequencies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>rOmp31 and rTF subunit vaccines</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26384448</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella melitensis Omp31 and trigger factor subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


