            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using isolated OMVs characterized as spherical 20-300 nm structures rich in proteins. Omvs showed immuno-reactivity with mice antisera and induced specific high-titer. Specific and high-titer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
