            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VO_0003390"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using three vaccine regimens: protein/protein, dna/dna, and dna/protein using omp2b antigen. Dna/protein regimen conferred higher protection levels against b. Melitensis and b. Abortus challenge compared to protein or DNA alone. All regimens elicited strong specific igg response with higher igg2a over igg1 titers indicating th1-oriented.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27938682</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella Omp2b subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


