                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus culture filtrate antigen subunit vaccine. Vaccine induced significant humoral and cellular. Vaccine elicited strong cellular immunity (delayed type hypersensitivity and ifn-γ production) and humoral immunity (antibody production), as well as enhanced phagocytic activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
