            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella conjugate vaccine using Brucella A antigen hexasaccharide and heptasaccharide conjugate vaccine. Vaccine candidates induced anti-a antibodies that bind internal oligosaccharide sequences while minimizing antibodies directed toward the terminal nonreducing monosaccharide, thus avoiding reaction with the diagnostic M antigen. This focused antibody response addresses the challenge of creating effective brucellosis vaccines without compromising diagnosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28386600</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella A antigen hexasaccharide and heptasaccharide conjugate vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


