                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus DNA vaccine using fusion DNA vaccines encoding bab1_0273 and/or bab1_0278 antigens conjugated to sodc protein. Vaccines conferred low levels of protection against challenge with b. Abortus 2308. Immunization induced specific humoral and cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
