            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using two molecular vaccines were constructed: a recombinant adenovirus vaccine and a plasmid DNA vaccine co-expressing P39 and lumazine synthase proteins. Dna priming followed by adenovirus boosting strategy significantly reduced the numbers of Brucella abortus in the mouse model. Dna prime and adenovirus boost immunization induced robust humoral and cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:29492808</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella abortus P39 and lumazine synthase adenovirus vector vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


