        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine that encoded by B. abortus genes aspC.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>single subunit vaccines encoded by aspC, dps, yaeC, and inpB genes</obo:IAO_0000118>
