            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live Brucella abortus constructs with chromosomal insertion of wbdr gene, some with deletion of the native wbkc formyltransferase gene, producing modified lipopolysaccharide structures. Wbdr constructs produced chronic infections in mice and elicited antibody responses distinguishable from wild-type strains, indicating potential for vaccine development. Modified vaccines triggered antibodies to new immunogenic epitopes lacking the a, m, and C epitopes of wild-type strains, allowing differentiation in serological tests.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
