        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine that is a study that aimed to compare calcium phosphate nanoparticles as antigen delivery systems using Omp31 protein, a candidate antigen for protection against Brucella melitensis; containing Omp31 subunit vaccine</obo:IAO_0000115>
