        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using malate dehydrogenase antigen was loaded into mucoadhesive chitosan nanoparticles (cns-mdh) for intranasal immunization. Cns-mdh induced significantly higher IL-6 production in THP-1 cells compared to controls. Vaccine elicited th2-related.</obo:IAO_0000115>
