        <obo:IAO_0000115>Combination vaccine using live attenuated salmonella strain engineered to secrete sodc antigen. Significant protection against Brucella abortus 544 challenge with protection index 0.85 in spleen and 1.37 in liver. Significant induction of brucella-specific systemic igg and secretory iga.</obo:IAO_0000115>
