        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using recombinant malate dehydrogenase protein loaded in chitosan nanoparticles administered intranasally. Antigen-specific total igg, predominantly igg1, was increased. Induction of mixed th1-th2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
