            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis omp31 epitopic region subunit vaccine fused to interleukin 2. Treatments with chimeric proteins significantly reduced splenocyte microbial load compared to controls. Recombinant proteins stimulated th1 cytokines (ifn-γ, il-2) and antibody production with higher igg2a than igg1 isotype.</obo:IAO_0000115>
