            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using flic protein was cloned, expressed, purified, and loaded onto mannosylated chitosan nanoparticles to create a targeted vaccine delivery system. Immunization with flic and flic-mcn conferred significant protection against Brucella melitensis 16 M and Brucella abortus 544 infections. Both flic and flic-mcn induced significant specific igg responses with higher igg2a titers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32017955</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella melitensis and Brucella abortus FliC subunit vaccine with Mannosylated Chitosan Nanoparticles adjuvant</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


