        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated mutant with deletion of the irr gene. M5-90δirr showed attenuated adhesion and invasion but enhanced intracellular replication and resistance to hydrogen peroxide.</obo:IAO_0000115>
