            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus recombinant vector vaccine using recombinant lactobacillus casei expressing OMP19 protein. Mice orally immunized with the recombinant vaccine showed very good protection against challenge with virulent b. Abortus 544 compared to negative controls. Vaccinated mice exhibited strong general and mucosal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>recombinant probiotic Lactobacillus casei vector vaccine expressing OMP19</obo:IAO_0000118>
