        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella omp2b protein vaccine. Identification of three linear B cell dominant epitopes, five cd8+ T cell dominant epitopes, and three cd4+ T cell dominant epitopes for omp2b.</obo:IAO_0000115>
