        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using Brucella abortus rnase E defective strain vaccine. Rne-tnc strain was attenuated in the mouse model, indicating reduced virulence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
