        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using live attenuated Brucella abortus strain 19 BA vaccine. Not directly reported. Statistically significant increase in CD25 expression by B cells and CD69 expression by T cells upon incubation with brucellosis polysaccharide-protein antigen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
