        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella ovis subunit vaccine using Brucella ovis blsomp31 subunit vaccine. Blsomp31/cpg-odn/coa-asc16 administered subcutaneously conferred significant protection against b. Ovis challenge. Subcutaneous administration stimulated a mixed th1-th2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
