        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using exosomes carrying IFITM3 protein derived from Brucella m5-infected macrophages. Immunization with ifitm3-containing exosomes decreased mouse spleen tissue damage and spleen cfu, establishing an anti-brucella state in mice. Exosomes transmitted IFITM3 protein from cell to cell, effectively inhibiting intracellular survival of Brucella.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
