            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella abortus vaccine using recombinant lactobacillus casei expressing OMP16 and PEDVS proteins. Vaccine induced higher levels of humoral, cellular, and mucosal immunity compared to other recombinant protein controls. Elevated serum igg, neutralizing antibodies, il-4, il-10, inf-γ, and fecal iga indicated strong humoral, cellular, and mucosal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
