        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella vaccine using live attenuated Brucella omp25 FMDV VP1 sheeppox virus strain NISKHI vector vaccine. Mice immunized with the recombinant virus elicited specific antibodies against both sheep pox virus and the foreign antigens VP1 and OMP25. Specific antibody responses to sheep pox virus and foreign proteins VP1 and OMP25 were induced in immunized mice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
