        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella abortus hlyd subunit vaccine. Omp19 substantially reduced the organ bacterial load of b. Abortus S19 in mice and provided protection. Induced specific humoral and cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
