            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine using Brucella 7alpha-hsdh subunit vaccine. Immunization with bhua protein plus poly i:c induced higher protection against b. Melitensis and b. Abortus than protein alone and comparable protection to live attenuated vaccines. Induced vigorous igg with predominant igg2a, high igg2a/igg1 ratio, splenocyte proliferation, and production of IL-2 and ifn-γ indicating a th1-oriented cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>7α-HSDH protein vaccine</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34673003</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella 7alpha-HSDH subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


