            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella bhua subunit vaccine. Immunization with bhua protein plus poly i:c induced higher protection against b. Melitensis and b. Abortus than protein alone and comparable protection to live attenuated vaccines. Induced vigorous igg with predominant igg2a, high igg2a/igg1 ratio, splenocyte proliferation, and production of IL-2 and ifn-γ indicating a th1-oriented cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
