            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella suis DNA vaccine using recombinant s2-ag85 DNA vaccine administered orally. S2-ag85a vaccine was effective in activating dsdna and RNA transduction pathways in intestinal cells and improving intestinal antigen presentation in mice. Activation of dsdna and RNA sensor pathways (rig-1, pol iii, dai, sting, aim2, irf3, irf7) in intestinal cells leading to enhanced antigen presentation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>oral S2-Ag85 DNA vaccine</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35465352</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>oral S2-Ag85 DNA vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


