        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis multi-epitope subunit vaccine. Animal experiments demonstrated high immunogenicity of the MEV. Mev elicited a strong.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
