            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated Brucella melitensis strain Rev. 1 with wzm gene deletion. Rev1δwzm mutant was highly attenuated yet immunogenic and effective as a vaccine against Brucella melitensis and Brucella ovis in mice. Rev1δwzm induced protective immunity without causing infection in mouse placentas and was safe in pregnant ewes, with minimal serological interference in sheep.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35875565</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>live attenuated Brucella melitensis strain Rev. 1 wzm deletion vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


