            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using the vaccine construct included 389 amino acids linked by aay, gpgpg, and EAAAK peptides, incorporated the PADRE sequence as a TLR2 and TLR4 agonist, resulting in a soluble, nonallergenic, antigenic protein of 41.3 kda. Vaccine is predicted to stimulate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:36115112</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-10-25T08:06:33Z</terms:date>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>vaccine</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:label>Brucella melitensis BtpA Omp16 Omp28 virB10 Omp25 Omp31 subunit vaccine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VO_0009514 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VO_0009514">
