        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella omp19 multi-epitope vaccine. Potential B cell and T cell epitopes of omp19 were identified as vaccine candidates, laying the foundation for further multi-epitope vaccine design.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
