        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella omp25 multi-epitope subunit vaccine. Potential B cell and T cell epitopes of omp19 were identified as vaccine candidates, laying the foundation for further multi-epitope vaccine design.</obo:IAO_0000115>
