        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella abortus subunit vaccine that combines Brucella abortus S19 smooth lipopolysaccharide with a Quillaja saponin and Xyloglucan mix to create a green vaccine aimed at mucosal brucellosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
