            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using LDH combined with Brucella outer-membrane vesicles and omv-associated proteins to form a subunit vaccine. Ldh subunit vaccine induced higher specific antibody levels and th1-type. Induced mainly t-helper 1 (th1)-type.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Brucella outer-membrane vesicles and outer-membrane vesicle-associated proteins subunit vaccine</obo:IAO_0000118>
