        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella melitensis vaccine using live attenuated strain with pgm gene deletion. Vaccine confers excellent levels of protection against b. Melitensis in mice and cross protection against b. Abortus and b. Suis. Vaccination induces a robust memory cellular.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
