        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine that is a study that aimed to evaluate immune responses induced by a chimeric protein consisting of trigger factor, Bp26, and Omp31 loaded on selenium nanoparticles as an adjuvant; containing trigger factor Bp26 Omp31 subunit vaccine; formulated with selenium nanoparticle</obo:IAO_0000115>
