        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella ovis vaccine using live attenuated Brucella ovis gamma irradiated vaccine with montanide ISA 61. Alginate/chitosan formulation elicited intense and long-lasting local response but with higher reactogenicity compared to montanide ISA 61. Induced intense local reactogenicity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
