            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella subunit vaccine using Brucella virb9 virb10 omp19 omp25 igv CTLA-4 subunit vaccine. V_c4mev demonstrated favorable immunogenicity and antigenicity, showing potential to activate defensive cells and. Vaccine showed potential to activate defensive immune cells and elicit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
