        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella DNA vaccine using plasmid DNA complexes with linear polyethylenimine to enhance DNA delivery. Single low-dose injection exerted a reliable protective effect against subsequent Brucella challenge.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
