            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella suis subunit vaccine using Brucella suis delta mapb outer membrane vesicle subunit vaccine. Immunization with δmapb OMVs induced higher antigen-specific igg titers than wild-type OMVs. Δmapb OMVs elicited robust humoral immunity with high igg titers and functional antibodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:39902052</obo:IAO_0000119>
