        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis conjugate vaccine using conjugate of detoxified LPS and tetanus toxoid (d-lps-tt). Mice immunized with d-lps-tt showed the strongest protective. Induced significant igg2a-specific serum responses targeting polysaccharide components.</obo:IAO_0000115>
