            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis lipopolysaccharide subunit vaccine with MONTANIDE ISA 61 VG. Vaccination with LPS alone did not provide protection against abortion, uterine, fetal, mammary, or maternal infection compared to controls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41441675</obo:IAO_0000119>
