        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella ovis vaccine using live attenuated vaccine based on Brucella ovis δabcba mutant. Β-glucan training did not enhance the efficacy of this attenuated vaccine. Trained innate immunity induced by β-glucan or zymosan was evaluated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
