            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella vaccine using live attenuated Brucella strain BA0711 vaccine. Vaccine strain BA0711 maintains strong host adaptability, viability, and immunogenicity despite genetic mutations and deletions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
