        <obo:IAO_0000115>Live attenuated Brucella ovis vaccine using live attenuated rough mutant strain h38δwbkf administered by subcutaneous or conjunctival routes. H38δwbkf vaccine protected rams against b. Ovis infection similarly to b. Melitensis Rev. 1 vaccine. H38δwbkf induced antibodies to rough LPS that interfered with b. Ovis serological tests.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117> Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>VaxAgent </obo:IAO_0000117>
