        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brucella melitensis subunit vaccine using Brucella melitensis high hydrophobic antigenic complex subunit vaccine encapsulated in microparticles. Subcellular vaccine induced protection similar to that of the live attenuated Brucella melitensis strain Rev. 1 vaccine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
